# Asset meta for project-owned assets should be committed.
# Commercial / third-party packs: ignore entire trees (local license only).

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party & Asset Store packs (folder blocklist — add new pack roots here)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/StylizedHandPaintedDungeon(Free)/
/[Aa]ssets/StylizedHandPaintedDungeon*/
/[Aa]ssets/DoubleL/
/[Aa]ssets/StylizedCharacter/
/[Aa]ssets/Hand Painted Stone Texture/
/[Aa]ssets/[Tt]hird[Pp]arty/
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]sset[Ss]tore/
# Optional: ignore a specific licensed plugin folder, e.g. /[Aa]ssets/Plugins/SomeStorePack/

